      "statement": "A course grade is ${{w1}}\\%$ coursework and ${{100 - w1}}\\%$ exam. A student scores ${{s1}}$ on coursework and ${{s2}}$ on the exam. What is the final grade, to one decimal place?",
      "answer": "${{fmt((w1*s1 + (100 - w1)*s2) / 100, 1)}}$",
